ontesano) sogna l'aristocrazia incarnata nel Principe Terenzi (Vittorio Gassman) ma dovrà fare i conti con la dura realtà di una nobiltà romana ormai decadente e rozza.  L'amore per la popolana Fernanda e la Duchessina Elisa, duelli e fughe, sono il filo portante che trova scenario nella Roma del 1910."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Count Tacchia","overview":"In 1900 in Rome, the poor carpenter Francesco, by a twist of fate, is recognized component of a noble family in the process of decay. Francesco knows the cynical and ruthless Prince Torquato Terenzi, disappointed by life and progress, and also falls in love with the beautiful Duchess Elisa. When Prince Terenzi dies, Francesco realizes that he's not enriched for nothing with the inheritance, because the noble family is broke; so he enlistes himself for the war in Libya, but quickly returnes to Italy, disgusted by the atrocities of the fighting. His dream is to be a singer, and so he goes to America with the Duchess Elisa."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bG7oNoXFigTGTN9J4vH50yzMQL2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lKprppMemPZkGJo4ffzDtM2ACXj.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":110265,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bG7oNoXFigTGTN9J4vH50yzMQL2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bG7oNoXFigTGTN9J4vH50yzMQL2.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1050},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bG7oNoXFigTGTN9J4vH50yzMQL2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bG7oNoXFigTGTN9J4vH50yzMQL2.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1050},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qvtGAL95UpqcD3ikfOSfnyEwLUm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qvtGAL95Upqc